  type_cpp_err_decltype_open.pcpp - break step of type_cpp.pcpp:
  decltype( never closed (PR0063 at its "(")

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_cpp_err_decltype_open.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_cpp_err_decltype_open.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
